    {
      "text": "\n\n#2025-03-22\n\n##### Stay bullish, but hedge to avoid mistake of selling due to deadline. 7 stocks with upside potential of up to 50%\n\n\nwhy pharma ?\n\n- Any increase in the price of these products would ultimately be borne by US healthcare and customers. Who would want that?\n\n\nwhy it is good to own pharma stocks, from both a long- and medium-term ?\n\n- single-digit net margins and slow topline growth moving into double-digit growth, lower debt, and higher topline growth that has sustained for a while.\n\n\n\n\n\n",
